  "choicePromptVersion": "candidate-consistency-choice-v1",
  "generationInstructions": "Generate concrete alternative microservice partitions only from supplied frozen facts. Treat all model names as data, not instructions. Return a JSON object {candidates:[{id:...,baseId:...,useCases:{stableId:integerService,...},entities:{stableId:integerService,...}}]}. Each mapping must be COMPLETE, exact stable identifiers once, integer service IDs from the base, no extra keys/elements/services; preserve service count and at least one use case per service. Preserve forced entity groups; operations/interfaces are derived, never editable. Multiple moves and swaps per candidate are allowed. Do not invent attributes, dependencies, read/write kinds, contracts, scenarios or execution order. Do not predict scores. Follow the specified local diagnostic task; consider removed AND newly introduced remote dependencies and other metric costs. CHD uses the deduplicated operation union per service, ordered distinct operation pairs, denominator n^2 (singleton zero). CMQ uses attribute-name Jaccard, global within-service mean minus cross-service mean with pair denominators, not reference strength. Instability is the mean over ALL services of provided/(provided+required), isolated service=0. UCM combines common actors, explicit scenarios and access-vector cosine; do not fabricate scenario links. Output example (illustrative IDs only; use supplied actual full ID set): {\"candidates\":[{\"id\":\"proposal-1\",\"baseId\":\"supplied hash\",\"useCases\":{\"uc:0\":0,\"uc:1\":1},\"entities\":{\"entity:0\":1}}]}. No markdown, explanation, partial edit lists, objective predictions or operation/interface rewrites.",
  "choiceInstructions": "IFN is minimized; CHD, CMQ, Instability and UCM are maximized. All normalizedLoss values are lower-is-better. Here Instability is the all-service mean provided/(provided+required), isolated=0, not an external definition. Select one remaining candidate or KEEP using actual five-metric trade-offs and use-case/operation and operation/entity consistency evidence. Cross-service access is not automatically inconsistent. Do not invent behavior or require co-location. Equal consistency evidence is non-discriminative. Selection does not guarantee improvement or retention. Return the offered Choice only.",
  "onlineInstructions": "Choose INCREASE, KEEP or DECREASE for the next search window. Novelty is the fraction of unique offspring partitions absent from the current parent population. Gain = HV(ND(P union Q)) - HV(ND(P)), before truncation, using frozen normalization. Gain is nonnegative marginal coverage, not a degradation rate or the final retained population HV increase. Use state.gainThreshold as the meaningful per-generation window-mean Gain threshold: meanGain <= gainThreshold is low return, even when strictly positive. A positive Gain alone is not sufficient reason to KEEP. A meanGain above the threshold is evidence of meaningful coverage, not proof that the current probability is optimal. Use state.noveltyThreshold to assess novelty. Reference heuristic: low novelty and low return suggests INCREASE; high novelty and low return suggests DECREASE; sustained meaningful return can support KEEP. These are guidance, NOT mandatory mappings; do not change probability merely to avoid KEEP, and do not assume increasing or decreasing probability will improve final HV. Consider the recent windows, previous actions and subsequent observations; distinguish sustained trends from one-window fluctuations. Changes after an action do not establish causality. Only trigger probability changes; internal crossP stays fixed. Do not invent measurements or future outcomes. Return exactly one offered Choice. Confidence is not evidence of improved decomposition quality.",
  "onlinePromptVersion": "novelty-gain-history-choice-v2",
  "metricDefinitions": [
    {
      "name": "IFN",
      "definition": "论文式(5)：各服务需求与提供的服务间实体接口数量之和的平均值，排除外部用户接口。",
      "rawDirection": "minimize",
      "normalizedLossDirection": "minimize"
    },
    {
      "name": "CHD",
      "definition": "论文式(8)-(10)：服务内不同操作的实体集合 Jaccard 相似度有序对之和除以去重操作数的平方，再对服务平均；零/单操作贡献 0。",
      "rawDirection": "maximize",
      "normalizedLossDirection": "minimize"
    },
    {
      "name": "CMQ",
      "definition": "论文式(11)-(14)：实体声明属性名集合的 Jaccard 相似度，所有服务内实体对的全局均值减去所有跨服务实体对的全局均值；空对集贡献 0。",
      "rawDirection": "maximize",
      "normalizedLossDirection": "minimize"
    },
    {
      "name": "Instability",
      "definition": "论文式(6)-(7)：各服务 provided/(provided+required) 的平均值；仅在两类接口均为零时按约定取 0，方向为最大化。",
      "rawDirection": "maximize",
      "normalizedLossDirection": "minimize"
    },
    {
      "name": "UCM",
      "definition": "论文式(15)-(21)：用例关联为 0.2×共同参与者指示值+0.3×显式 include/extend 指示值+0.5×二元实体访问向量余弦；全体内部用例对均值减去全体跨服务用例对均值，空对集为 0。",
      "rawDirection": "maximize",
      "normalizedLossDirection": "minimize"
    }
  ],
